   priority than t4.  However, before reload, there is no dependence
   between t1 and t3, and they can often have similar priorities.
   The scheduler will then tend to prefer:

	t1 = a * b
	t3 = e * f
	t2 = t1 + c * d
	t4 = t3 - g * h

